# Default mode is the complete offline demo; no credentials are required.
# Explicit ?mode=live selects the disconnected provider readiness UI.
# Provider-specific environment variable names/auth formats will be added only after
# an official API contract and an agreement authorizing Flight AI's use are reviewed.
# Keep all issued secrets server-side. Never use NEXT_PUBLIC_* for provider secrets.
# Do not add website session cookies, guessed API base URLs, or scraped access tokens.

# Optional server-only natural-language interpretation. Structured recommendation
# controls remain functional without these. Configure a model available to your
# OpenAI project that supports Responses API strict JSON-schema structured outputs.
# Both values are required. The documented low-cost extraction model is selected
# explicitly below; verify model access in your OpenAI project. Never NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5.6-luna
# Requests use only https://api.openai.com/v1/responses. No custom base URL,
# automatic retries, tools, provider booking calls or stored conversation.
